    },

    {
      "id": "n2",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Two weeks have passed since Cassian's outburst. Things have settled into an uneasy rhythm.",
      "next": "n3"
    },

    {
      "id": "n3",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "play_music",
      "track": "assets/music/sunset_peace.ogg",
      "volume": 0.4,
      "next": "n4"
    },

    {
      "id": "n4",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "show_character",
      "character": "tiffany",
      "pose": "default_smile",
      "position": "center",
      "transition": "fade",
      "duration": 0.5,
      "next": "n5"
    },

    {
      "id": "n5",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Tiffany",
      "character": "tiffany",
      "pose": "default_smile",
      "text": "I'm glad everyone could make it today. I have some news about the festival.",
      "next": "n6"
    },

    {
      "id": "n6",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "show_character",
      "character": "hanami",
      "pose": "smile",
      "position": "left",
      "transition": "slide_left",
      "duration": 0.4,
      "next": "n7"
    },

    {
      "id": "n7",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "show_character",
      "character": "cassian",
      "pose": "neutral",
      "position": "right",
      "transition": "slide_right",
      "duration": 0.4,
      "next": "n8"
    },

    {
      "id": "n8",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "show_character",
      "character": "laura",
      "pose": "shy",
      "position": "far_left",
      "transition": "fade",
      "duration": 0.5,
      "next": "n9"
    },

    {
      "id": "n9",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Hanami",
      "character": "hanami",
      "pose": "smile",
      "text": "What is it?",
      "next": "n10"
    },

    {
      "id": "n10",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Tiffany",
      "character": "tiffany",
      "pose": "happy",
      "text": "We've been approved for a thirty-minute performance slot! Isn't that wonderful?",
      "next": "n11"
    },

    {
      "id": "n11",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Cassian",
      "character": "cassian",
      "pose": "smirk",
      "text": "Thirty minutes? That's ambitious. Think we can handle it?",
      "next": "n12"
    },

    {
      "id": "n12",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Tiffany",
      "character": "tiffany",
      "pose": "default_smile",
      "text": "With proper practice, absolutely. We'll need to rehearse at least three times a week.",
      "next": "n13"
    },

    {
      "id": "n13",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "laura",
      "character": "laura",
      "pose": "nervous",
      "text": "Um... three times? I... I'm not sure I can...",
      "next": "n14"
    },

    {
      "id": "n14",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Tiffany",
      "character": "tiffany",
      "pose": "neutral",
      "text": "It's okay, laura. We'll work around everyone's schedules. The important thing is that we all commit.",
      "next": "n15"
    },

    {
      "id": "n15",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Hanami",
      "character": "hanami",
      "pose": "gentle",
      "text": "I think it'll be great. We've come a long way already.",
      "next": "n16"
    },

    {
      "id": "n16",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "MC",
      "text": "I'm in. This could be really special.",
      "next": "n17"
    },

    {
      "id": "n17",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Cassian",
      "character": "cassian",
      "pose": "neutral",
      "text": "Fine. But no slacking. If we're doing this, we're doing it right.",
      "next": "n18"
    },

    {
      "id": "n18",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Tiffany",
      "character": "tiffany",
      "pose": "happy",
      "text": "Excellent! Then it's settled. Let's start with a full group piece tonight.",
      "next": "n19"
    },

    {
      "id": "n19",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Everyone moves into position. The air feels charged with possibility.",
      "next": "n20"
    },

    {
      "id": "n20",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Tiffany",
      "character": "tiffany",
      "pose": "default_smile",
      "text": "This piece is called 'Converging Paths.' It's about finding unity despite differences.",
      "next": "n21"
    },

    {
      "id": "n21",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Hanami",
      "character": "hanami",
      "pose": "smile",
      "text": "I love that. It feels... fitting.",
      "next": "n22"
    },

    {
      "id": "n22",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "play_sound",
      "sound": "assets/sounds/countdown_beep.wav",
      "volume": 0.5,
      "next": "n23"
    },

    {
      "id": "n23",
      "type": "game",
      "song": "converging_paths",
      "next": "n24"
    },

    {
      "id": "n24",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The final note rings out. For a moment, everything feels perfect.",
      "next": "n25"
    },

    {
      "id": "n25",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Cassian",
      "character": "cassian",
      "pose": "smirk",
      "text": "...Not bad. We might actually pull this off.",
      "next": "n26"
    },

    {
      "id": "n26",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "laura",
      "character": "laura",
      "pose": "shy",
      "text": "That was... that was really nice.",
      "next": "n27"
    },

    {
      "id": "n27",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Hanami",
      "character": "hanami",
      "pose": "smile",
      "text": "We sound good together. Really good.",
      "next": "n28"
    },

    {
      "id": "n28",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Tiffany",
      "character": "tiffany",
      "pose": "happy",
      "text": "See? I knew we could do this. We're going to make the festival unforgettable.",
      "next": "n29"
    },

    {
      "id": "n29",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Tiffany's smile is radiant. She looks genuinely happy, proud of what the group has become.",
      "next": "n30"
    },

    {
      "id": "n30",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "MC",
      "text": "Thanks for pulling us all together, Tiffany.",
      "next": "n31"
    },

    {
      "id": "n31",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Tiffany",
      "character": "tiffany",
      "pose": "default_smile",
      "text": "That's what a president does. I just want everyone to shine.",
      "next": "n32"
    },

    {
      "id": "n32",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "But there's something in her eyes. A flicker of something beneath the confidence.",
      "next": "n33"
    },

    {
      "id": "n33",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "You can't quite place it. And before you can think about it further, it's gone.",
      "next": "n34"
    },

    {
      "id": "n34",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "set_bg",
      "background": "assets/images/bg/clubroom_night.png",
      "transition": "fade",
      "duration": 1.0,
      "next": "n35"
    },

    {
      "id": "n35",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Practice runs late. One by one, everyone starts packing up.",
      "next": "n36"
    },

    {
      "id": "n36",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Cassian",
      "character": "cassian",
      "pose": "neutral",
      "text": "Same time tomorrow?",
      "next": "n37"
    },

    {
      "id": "n37",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Tiffany",
      "character": "tiffany",
      "pose": "default_smile",
      "text": "Yes. And don't be late.",
      "next": "n38"
    },

    {
      "id": "n38",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Cassian",
      "character": "cassian",
      "pose": "smirk",
      "text": "Wouldn't dream of it.",
      "next": "n39"
    },

    {
      "id": "n39",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "hide_character",
      "character": "cassian",
      "next": "n40"
    },

    {
      "id": "n40",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "laura",
      "character": "laura",
      "pose": "shy",
      "text": "G-goodnight, everyone...",
      "next": "n41"
    },

    {
      "id": "n41",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "hide_character",
      "character": "laura",
      "next": "n42"
    },

    {
      "id": "n42",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Hanami",
      "character": "hanami",
      "pose": "smile",
      "text": "This is going to be amazing. I can feel it.",
      "next": "n43"
    },

    {
      "id": "n43",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "MC",
      "text": "Yeah. I think you're right.",
      "next": "n44"
    },

    {
      "id": "n44",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "hide_character",
      "character": "hanami",
      "next": "n45"
    },

    {
      "id": "n45",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Soon, it's just you and Tiffany left in the clubroom.",
      "next": "n46"
    },

    {
      "id": "n46",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Tiffany",
      "character": "tiffany",
      "pose": "neutral",
      "text": "You should head home too. It's getting late.",
      "next": "n47"
    },

    {
      "id": "n47",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "MC",
      "text": "What about you?",
      "next": "n48"
    },

    {
      "id": "n48",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Tiffany",
      "character": "tiffany",
      "pose": "default_smile",
      "text": "I'll lock up. I always do.",
      "next": "n49"
    },

    {
      "id": "n49",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "She turns back to the window, looking out at the night.",
      "next": "n50"
    },

    {
      "id": "n50",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "MC",
      "text": "Alright. See you tomorrow.",
      "next": "n51"
    },

    {
      "id": "n51",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Tiffany",
      "character": "tiffany",
      "pose": "default_smile",
      "text": "See you tomorrow.",
      "next": "n52"
    },

    {
      "id": "n52",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "set_bg",
      "background": "assets/images/bg/night_street.png",
      "transition": "fade",
      "duration": 0.8,
      "next": "n53"
    },

    {
      "id": "n53",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "hide_character",
      "character": "tiffany",
      "next": "n54"
    },

    {
      "id": "n54",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The walk home is quiet. Streetlights flicker overhead.",
      "next": "n55"
    },

    {
      "id": "n55",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "You think about the music club. About how everyone seems to fit together, despite the rough edges.",
      "next": "n56"
    },

    {
      "id": "n56",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It feels like something real. Something worth holding onto.",
      "next": "n57"
    },

    {
      "id": "n57",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "You don't know it yet, but this is the calm before everything changes.",
      "next": "n58"
    },

    {
      "id": "n58",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "set_bg",
      "background": "assets/images/bg/black.png",
      "transition": "fade",
      "duration": 1.5,
      "next": "n59"
    },

    {
      "id": "n59",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "End of Act 1.",
      "next": "n60"
    },

